# No graph, assignment count, owned implementation paths or thresholds change.
for _continuation_pr in PRS:
    if _continuation_pr['id'] == 'PR-009':
        _continuation_pr['commits'][0]['instructions'] += ' Owner direction is "Cheap as possible don\'t orrry about that for now". Record cost minimization using existing infrastructure first and a null, owner-deferred numeric budget. This is neither a zero-dollar cap nor paid-resource authorization. Keep measured_cheapest_new_topology null while actual account/workload/cost/capacity/recovery/rights evidence is missing. Missing numeric budget alone does not block the independently reviewable pure policy/receipt engineering. C-009-1 remains an unresolved architecture qualification; its original measured-decision requirement is not satisfied by this staged engineering scope.'
        _continuation_pr['commits'][0]['verification'] += ' Retain the historical C-009-1-topology-unmeasured documentation observation and add C-009-1-measured-topology-qualification with status unresolved. Keep ADR 0008 Proposed/in_progress, earlier accepted ADR bytes unchanged, and the current static public runtime and all disabled activation boundaries intact. PR077/PR078 may supply later evidence to this still-owned qualification; no reverse dependency is added.'
        _continuation_pr['acceptance'].append('Staged engineering integration may separately accept C-009-2/C-009-3 only after independent verification of the exact pure policy/module/schema/fixture interfaces and an actual accepted PR008 integration. Record its separate controller receipt and actual component/integration identities. Retain explicit unresolved C-009-1-measured-topology-qualification; this engineering integration does not qualify the overall PR009 architecture, accept R03/R14/R15/R16, authorize paid resources or activate collection, managed persistence, sample storage, inference or production composition.')
    if _continuation_pr['id'] == 'PR-010':
        _continuation_pr['acceptance'].append('For this bounded fixture-only engineering scope, consume an actual merged and integrated PR009 policy/receipt interface with independent C-009-2/C-009-3 acceptance, exact artifact hashes, canonical descriptor hash basis ushso-canonical-json.v1 and an explicit still-unresolved C-009-1 qualification record. Bind the actual PR009 component merge SHA and separate integration identity against the live ledger and ancestry. A producer head, null SHA, passing handoff parser or unknown-state documentation check is insufficient. Before dispatch, review the exact accepted dependency interfaces and resolve the pending descriptor-hash resolver and CLI ownership contracts; this amendment selects no signature, module path, package script or implementation contract. It enables no live collection, managed persistence, paid inference, sample storage or production composition and grants no general readiness to other PR009 consumers.')
    if _continuation_pr['id'] == 'PR-077':
        _continuation_pr['commits'][2]['verification'] += ' Include an explicit disposition of PR009/C-009-1 measured-topology qualification using actual account terms/shared allowances, measured steady/burst workload and cost, storage/transfer, and unchanged rights/capacity/recovery constraints. Public prices and publication asset lengths alone are insufficient. Owner budget deferral is neither a zero-dollar cap nor proof of a cheapest topology. Keep C-009-1 unresolved if its required evidence is absent.'
    if _continuation_pr['id'] == 'PR-078':
        _continuation_pr['acceptance'].append('Supply applicable measured recovery and evidenced retention/rights inputs to PR009/C-009-1 qualification. Preserve existing provisional recovery objectives, residency, metadata-only evidence and the separate sample-store decision. Configuration, a planned drill or an earlier static Worker rollback target is not a managed restore/failover result.')
    if _continuation_pr['id'] == 'PR-082':
        _continuation_pr['acceptance'].append('Full program/release qualification must explicitly evaluate PR009/C-009-1. Merged/integrated engineering with unresolved measured-topology qualification is not a pass. Consume the exact independent cost/capacity/recovery/rights decision and applicable authorization; reject unresolved required qualification rather than counting engineering dependency integration as full acceptance. Preserve all R01-R16 thresholds and denominators.')
